// File:Tiger_Front_View.png, File:Tiger_Top_View.png - UK Government work, public domain; local
// copies output/refs/tiger_i_ausf_e/, see output/refs/SOURCES.md), with scripts/refs/trace_silhouette.py.
// The drawings carry their own dimensions: 27 ft 9 in (8.458 m) overall, 12 ft 3 in (3.734 m) over
// the wide tracks, 12 ft 8 in (3.861 m) to the aerial, 5 ft 10 in (1.778 m) to the hull side top,
// 1 ft 5 in (0.432 m) clearance, 11 ft 10 1/8 in (3.61 m) contact run. Side and front calibrate to
// 0.362 / 0.359 cm/px, the plan to 0.350 - one scale within 3 %. Target with floors until K3
// builds the Tiger.
